  (text "1. MODE AND RECOVERY"
    (at 25.4 20.32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "50c950be-9a8d-4dc9-a137-50e0731eed69"))
  (text "NORMAL: TS probe and VBUS run-inhibit untouched. SERVICE: charging disabled, battery run permitted.\nRecovery: unplug USB; POWER OFF and discharge; SERVICE; hold BOOT; POWER ON; attach data cable.\nAfter use: unplug USB before returning NORMAL. Empty battery: charge in NORMAL first."
    (at 25.4 76.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "a5798ea7-0e8b-4b3c-b3bb-ab4ae5f60332"))
  (text "2. HARDWARE VBUS QUALIFICATION"
    (at 25.4 91.44 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "00ba7adc-5103-4438-9960-baca3317dcff"))
  (text "R7304/R7305: 0.1% divider, nominal 4.455 V falling threshold.\nCT open: 12..28 ms release. U7302 on usb_enable_gate also qualifies main rail.\nBoth open-drain monitors must release before DATA_EN can rise."
    (at 25.4 172.72 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "28575205-2ec0-46db-87f5-0598604ad608"))
  (text "3. USB FULL-SPEED PATH"
    (at 25.4 190.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "17df4864-3473-4a3f-acfb-d27ec36d9573"))
  (text "J201 -> D7301 -> U1101 CH3/CH4 -> 22 ohm -> MCU GPIO20/19.\nPlace TVS at connector, series resistors at MCU. Keep D+/D- coupled over GND.\nNo bus-power or charging during SERVICE. USB-only recovery with an empty battery is unsupported."
    (at 25.4 243.84 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "917a6f53-719e-480f-be5a-72c2ef68bc6c")))
